  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FADEC/SUD Cereal Banks Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to construct cereal banks; stock their production; improve marketing options; reduce speculation on grains; improved post-harvest losses and improve food security. This directly benefits 22;700 farmers in five districts by allowing local communities to store grainand increase production levels.</narrative>
  </description>
